      "content": "Start by immediately pausing the chargeback decision and sending the customer a personalized apology with a full refund offer to instantly de-escalate tensions. Provide a clear, non-legalistic explanation of the carrier's findings without sounding definitive as if you are declaring them the absolute winner, emphasizing that the refund covers their inconvenience regardless of liability. This approach prioritizes relationship preservation over immediate financial recovery, effectively preventing the CSAT drop and chargeback while keeping the cost low.",
